messages.content:
Reformat these quest descriptions into player-friendly journal entries:

{
  "PP001": {
    "title": "Desperate Defense",
    "description": "The party arrives at Rangers' Outpost to find it in crisis. Three caravans have been massacred in five days with unnatural precision. Ranger Elen, the outpost's commander, recruits the party. Her prime lead is the captured Bandit Leader, Rusk, a man now terrified of his new master. The party must interrogate Rusk to learn the location of the main bandit camp and the identity of the sorcerer, Malarok, who now commands them. IMPORTANT: This plot point should be marked COMPLETED immediately after Rusk reveals the bandit camp location (old watchtower in Thornwood) and Malarok's identity - do not wait for expedition planning or other preparations.",
    "status": "completed"
  }
}

gpt-5-mini.output:
{
  "PP001": "You arrived at the Rangers' Outpost amid panic and, at Ranger Elen's request, interrogated the captured bandit Rusk; he revealed the bandit camp in the old watchtower in Thornwood and that the sorcerer Malarok now commands them."
}
